\newlabel{fig:twoaxes}{{6}{20}{\textbf {One failure class, two instances.} Temporal axis: labels that peek at the future manufacture a phantom frontier; the fix is the minimal pair, the same utterance with and without an observable silence tail. Contextual axis: a context prefix that always matches the audio becomes a copyable shortcut; the fix is the counterfactual twin, the same audio with a matching and a disagreeing context, target following the audio.\relax }{figure.caption.30}{}}
